    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a new manager here and starting to get some questions about how we handle performance issues. Can you give me a quick summary of how our progressive discipline policy usually works? I just want to make sure I'm following the right steps for documentation and fairness from the start.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
