      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Our progressive discipline policy generally follows a staged approach to address performance concerns. Typically, it begins with informal coaching and verbal warnings to correct minor issues. If the performance doesn't improve, the process moves to written warnings, and ultimately, more severe actions like final warnings or termination. Consistent documentation at every stage is crucial to ensure fairness and legal defensibility throughout the process.",
