    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. i'll make sure to keep a log. one more thing though—what if it feels like the person is doing it on purpose to mess with the system? like, they know exactly how much they can get away with without hitting a major violation. how do we address that kind of 'bad faith' behavior in the documentation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
