      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Addressing perceived bad faith requires focusing documentation strictly on the observable behavior and policy violation, not on intent. Detail the specific rules they are circumventing, noting *how* their actions fall just outside the defined violations. If possible, direct coaching to future compliance with the spirit of the rule can be effective. Keep the conversation objective, referencing performance standards rather than assigning a motive.",
